<title>AUSTRIA: Austria sees 98/99 budget deficit at 2.6 pct GDP.</title>
<headline>Austria sees 98/99 budget deficit at 2.6 pct GDP.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Finance Minister Rudolf Edlinger said on Thursday the central government's budget deficit for 1998 and 1999 was expected to be 2.6 percent of gross domestic product (GDP).</p>
<p>Edlinger also told reporters the overall budget deficit, including regional government, would reach 3.0 percent of GDP this year as planned, putting Austria on course for the starting group of Europe's single currency.</p>
</text>
